--- (3) THE SCORING CONTRACT (pre-registered here, before any real catalog) ---
    A catalog of N pairs (columns s, M_star,1, M_star,2, z, g_ext) DECIDES the
    q = 1 merger-census law at 3 sigma when ALL of the following hold:
      (i) CORNER RESOLUTION: a pre-registered corner bin carries N_bin >= N3 and its
          measured ratio R_meas = f_pair,cat(s-bin)/f_pair,obs(s-bin) clears the null
          on the predicted side at >= 3 sigma (|R_meas - 1 - delta_pred| <= 3 sigma_bin,
          sigma_bin^2 = 1/N_bin + sys^2):
          * DEEP-DEFICIT corner (member M_b <= 3e10, s in [40, 60] kpc,
            R_pred <= 0.60):  N3(0.46, 0.10) = 75, N3(0.52, 0.10) = 50 --
            N <= 100 pairs per bin at a 10% systematic (G121 V3);
          * MASSIVE-EXCESS corner (member M_b >= 1e11, s in [10, 20] kpc,
            R_pred >= 1.15):  N3(0.15, 0.00) = 400, N3(0.20, 0.00) = 225 --
            N ~ 300 sys-free; the systematic floor must be <= 5% (N3(0.20, 0.05) = 515;
            the +15% row is unreachable at sys = 5%);
      (ii) SHAPE: q_meas = d log10(R_meas)/d log10(1 + r_M/s) over >= 3 populated
           universal bins lies in [0.5, 1.5] with |q_meas - 1| <= 3 sigma_q;
      (iii) NO FALSIFIER FIRES: F1 (R_meas <= 1.00 at the anchor bin s/r_M in
            [2/3, 4/3]), F2 (slope outside [0.5, 1.5]), F3 (residuals correlate with
            g_ext at |Spearman| > 0.3, n >= 50, or residual scatter > 20% -- the
            M_b-only statement), F4 (the excess confined outside the registered
            10-60 kpc window).
    The prime-mass centroid (-2 to -5%) is explicitly NOT 3-sigma-decidable at any
    achievable N (G121 V3): the test resolves on the corners and the shape.  A catalog
    satisfying (i)-(iii) DECIDES q = 1; a guard violation fires the falsifier;
    otherwise INCONCLUSIVE.
  [PASS] C8 [the N3 arithmetic] the contract's sample numbers reproduce G121's committed N3 table exactly (101/57/515/134 at (0.3,0)/(0.5,0.1)/(0.2,0.05)/(0.3,0.05)); the corner N3s: deep-deficit 75-50 @ sys 10%, massive 400-225 sys-free   {'N3_0p30_sys0': 101, 'N3_0p50_sys0p10': 57, 'N3_0p20_sys0p05': 515, 'N3_0p30_sys0p05': 134, 'N3_0p46_sys0p10': 75, 'N3_0p52_sys0p10': 50, 'N3_0p15_sys0': 401, 'N3_0p20_sys0': 225}

